* main.a99 - the main module of the obj2ea5 demo: two object files
* linked into a RUN PROGRAM FILE image by tools/obj2ea5.py.  It REFs
* SHOW and MSG from lib.a99, shows MSG on row 12, waits about three
* seconds and goes back to RUN PROGRAM FILE.  Build (see README.md):
*   xas99.py -R main.a99 -o main.obj
*   xas99.py -R lib.a99 -o lib.obj
*   tools/obj2ea5.py lib.obj main.obj --disk demo.dsk --name LINKA
* lib first on purpose: the entry is then not the lowest address, and
* the image starts with the four-byte stub.
       DEF  START
       REF  SHOW,MSG
START  MOV  R11,R9            the way back to RUN PROGRAM FILE
       LI   R0,12*32+2        row 12, column 2
       LI   R1,MSG
       BL   @SHOW
       LI   R2,6              about three seconds at the console's speed
WAIT1  CLR  R3
WAIT2  DEC  R3
       JNE  WAIT2
       DEC  R2
       JNE  WAIT1
       B    *R9
       END  START
